			<Comment Bounds="285 100 315 95" Id="63" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"The StatusBar generates the Resized event when it\nresizes or moves on the panel of the VI. The user\ninterface can then move and resize the other controls\non the panel appropriately.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it\nis an ActiveX event callback VI."</p.Text>
